==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Gible|96}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Gible}}.
*{{m|Tackle}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Gible}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

